Third-party components

Playwright viewer bundle
  Path: ui/public/browser-viewer/upstream/
  From: the carapa-playwright fork (https://github.com/carapa-ai/playwright,
    branch carapa-browser-viewer-1.66) of Microsoft Playwright
    (https://github.com/microsoft/playwright)
  Source commit: 58ef715f610229f18c3e332be2e8f01926094122
  License: Apache License 2.0; the license text is in
    ui/public/browser-viewer/upstream/LICENSE
  Version: recorded in ui/public/browser-viewer/version.json

The fork adds Carapa viewer changes (sidebars, viewport presets, custom select
menus, audio). This bundle is built from the Playwright dashboard sources of
that fork, checked out at the path named by PLAYWRIGHT_ROOT
(scripts/build-browser-viewer.sh). During vendoring
(scripts/vendor-browser-viewer.py) its asset URLs are rewritten to relative
paths and its default mode is switched from read-only to interactive.

This component remains under the Apache License 2.0 and is not covered by the
PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 that applies to the rest of this project.

